				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				66,
				3
			],
			"Message": "docs(Maintain): improve table formatting in DeepDive documentation\n\nEnhance markdown table readability in Documentation/GitHub/DeepDive.md by adjusting column width specifications and text wrapping. The table column definitions now use explicit widths (e.g., :---, :-----------------------------------------) instead of generic placeholders, providing better visual alignment in markdown renderers.\n\nAlso normalize the rustdocflags array in .cargo/config.toml to single-line format for consistency.",
			"SHA": "64d6a04ec28b6abd8cb6f0017431e64ae562af07"
		},
