				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Maintain): add mountain emoji to Land Ecosystem section header\n\nEnhance the Maintain README header by adding the 🏞️ (mountain with summit) emoji alongside the existing 💪 (flexed biceps) emoji in the \"Maintain in the Land Ecosystem\" section title.\n\nThis visual addition reinforces the Maintain component's role as part of the Land ecosystem's build infrastructure.",
